WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Ingenuity hovers above the Martian ground. First-flight footage, April 19, 2021.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The small helicopter and its shadow appear against the rocky surface of Jezero crater.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A historical view filmed by Perseverance. This silent excerpt is cropped for visibility.
